项王，如今你明白狂妄与固执让你付出了多大的代价，\n若你痛惜虞姬的逝去，就更不能:
Xiang Yu, now you understand how much arrogance and stubbornness have cost you,
if you mourn Lady Yu's passing, you must not let down his hopes and hopes for you,
you must pull yourself together soon and take on your destiny once again...

项王，长久以来你一直走在疯狂与自灭的歧路上，\n若非虞姬赌上性命，在最后关头将你:
Xiang Yu, for a long time you have walked the path of madness and self-destruction,
if Yu Ji hadn't risked his life to save you from the edge of a cliff at the last moment,
No one in the world could restrain the wild nature of the Overlord Sword, and everything would be doomed.

…恕之，你还提这些陈年往事，老夫早就不计较啦，\n说回来还是得怪老夫思虑未周，草:
… Forgive me, but you still bring up these old stories? I wouldn't have held it against you long ago,
In the end, I still have to blame for my lack of foresight and for hastily sending you to Shu to help quell the rebellion,
if you are taken advantage of by villains, the outcome can't be entirely blamed on you,

不用多费心了…其实有件事我没老实告诉你，\n若非你身上还带着那条狼皮，这一剑我未:
No need to worry too much... Actually, there's something I haven't honestly told you,
if you hadn't had that wolf skin on you, I might not have lost this sword to you,
but fate arranged it this way... Maybe that's the real thing... The best ...

你们五大派过去都与他有仇怨，此刻又全都聚集于此，\n如果让他知道你们在这里，他必:
Your five major sects have all held grudges against him in the past, and now they are all gathered here,
if he finds out you are here, he definitely won't miss this opportunity,
so I am here to remind you: don't underestimate Shen Wuming or the weapons in his hands.

勇而轻死者，可暴也；急而心速者，可久也；\n贪而好利者，可遗也；仁而不忍人者，可:
Those who are brave but disregard death can be violated; Those who are urgent and quick in heart can endure for a long time;
Those who are greedy and fond of profit can be set aside; Those who are benevolent but can't bear to harm others are worthy of toil;
Those who are wise but timid in heart can be troubled; Those who trust and delight in trusting others can be deceived;

呵呵，这种小事兰姐姐可千万别放在心上，\n若没有妳一直在旁陪伴，在我遇上困惑疑难:
Heh, Sister Lan, please don't take such a small matter to heart,
if you hadn't been by my side, guiding me whenever I faced confusion or difficulty,
I absolutely couldn't have traveled this wild journey to come here.

太虚金仙为此特别炼制了这个玉佩，要我带回去交给小红，\n这玉佩能克制她身上的血灵:
Taixu Golden Immortal specially crafted this jade pendant for this purpose, asking me to take it back and give it to Xiaohong,
this jade pendant could suppress the blood spirit power on her body. As long as she kept it close to her body,
if the Blood Spirit can't awaken when she turns twelve, it will disappear forever,

左前辈，晚辈自知武功低微、见识浅薄，\n若在前辈这般高人面前说谎欺瞒，必定会马上:
Senior Zuo, I know my martial skills are low and my knowledge shallow,
if you lie or deceive in front of such a master as a senior, you'll be exposed immediately,
I'm not lying; if you insist on making things difficult, there is nothing you can do.

慕容观主请各派掌门率领门下弟子做好准备伺机而动，\n若辽国奸细察觉事有蹊跷，或是:
The Murong Temple Master asked the sect leaders of each sect to lead their disciples to prepare and wait for the right moment to act,
if a Liao spy senses something is amiss, or somehow manages to escape the Ten Thousand Demons Forbidden Immortal Array,
The five major factions would launch a flank and encircle them, ensuring they couldn't escape.

而妳是为了寻回霸剑，实现大辽皇帝的野心而来，\n若妳成功了，大辽必定会如十几年前:
And you came to retrieve the Overlord Sword and fulfill the ambition of the Liao Emperor,
if you succeed, Great Liao will surely invade south again, just as it did more than a decade ago,
I can't stand by and watch my friends be caught up in this war and disaster.

话说回来，听说左前辈自恃身份很少在外走动，\n他平常都待在黄山紫杳峰的宫殿里练功:
That said, I heard that Senior Zuo, relying on his status, rarely goes out,
he usually stayed in the palace on Ziyao Peak on Huangshan to train and cultivate his character, living in seclusion,
if there is nothing he is interested in, even the emperor can't summon him,

只有像你们这样的勇者才能解除我的诅咒，\n请你们看在同为武人的份上助我一臂之力，:
Only brave people like you can lift my curse,
please, for the sake of fellow warriors, lend me a hand,
let me let go of my long-held burdens and end this bloody wandering... )

等等，我想起来了…我的包袱里还有一柄剑，\n那柄藏在凛铁寒匣中，在东城之原被怪老:
Wait, I remember now... There is still a sword in my bundle,
that sword, hidden in the Iron Cold Box, was repaired by the strange old man in the Dongcheng Plains,
if it were that sword, perhaps it could make Foster Father... )

而师父这人想法极端，兼之心思反复、喜怒无常，\n倘若他临时起了什么念头，后果只怕:
But Master is an extreme thinker, with fickle, moody moods,
if he had any sudden idea, the consequences would have been unimaginable,
The more we stayed here, the more danger it was; it was better to leave as soon as possible.

（嘶…不自量力的傻子，这是你们多管闲事，\n那人原就注定会落在我手中，而我等这已:
(Hiss... Overestimating yourself, fools, this is your meddling,
that person was destined to fall into my hands, and I have waited for this for a long time,
if you insist on interfering recklessly, then there's nothing more to say... )

（看来李庙祝的心事可能与神秘盗匪有关连，\n如果我能找到他然后向他询问庙后墙上那:
(It seems Shrinekeeper Li's worries might be connected to mysterious bandits,
if I can find him and ask him about the bloodstain on the wall behind the temple,
maybe I could get something out of him... )

多谢小前辈，您愿意帮忙就已经足够，\n得能借重您的渊博见识，这批妖人就不足为惧，:
Thank you, senior. Your willingness to help is already enough,
if I can rely on your profound knowledge, then these demons will not be to fear,
From now on. I'll look forward to your guidance, senior.

既然如此，我们就不多打搅公输兄的研究了，\n若两位没有他事，我们就趁天色还早到城:
Since that's the case, let's not disturb Brother Gongshu's research any further,
if you two have nothing else, let's take advantage of the early days and go to the city for a walk,
Next time, if there's a chance. I'll come to the residence to bother you a bit.

申少侠不需客气。之后我会先到开封城里四处走走，\n若孙某的推占没错，这开封城应该:
No need to be so polite, Young Hero Shen. After that. I'll first take a walk around Kaifeng Village,
if Sun's prediction is correct, then this Kaifeng should be exactly what all the signs suggest,
although the atmosphere here was extremely chaotic, some clues could still be detected,

…公输兄真厉害，能在这种地方安置如此精巧的机关，\n要是我们没有你带路，就算在这:
… Brother Gongshu is truly impressive, able to set up such intricate mechanisms in such a place,
if we didn't have you to guide us, even if we spent ten days or half a month searching here,
nor would they have noticed that there was actually an authentic entrance here.

…医铺的李大夫着实是个顽固之人，\n如果想让他看病，就得乖乖听他的吩咐，\n不过:
… Physician Li at the clinic is truly a stubborn person,
if you want him to see a doctor, you have to obediently follow his instructions,
but his medical skills are truly impressive.

…呵呵，申兄弟客气了，\n何某不过是个略通枪法，四处流浪的浮浪酒徒，\n如果是喝:
… Hehe, Brother Shen, you're too polite,
I am just a wandering drunkard with some knowledge of marksmanship, wandering from place to place,
if it's drinking and chatting about the jianghu anecdotes, Mr. He is very happy to accompany me,

…哼，总之…你就跟着他们下山好好玩吧，\n如果下次你有机会回来，记得带些有趣的东:
… Hmph, anyway... Just follow them down the mountain and have fun,
if you have the chance to come back next time, remember to bring us something interesting,
maybe I can share some small discoveries with you... Remember it well!

…天地之间虽广，能掩藏霸剑锋芒的地方却不多，\n若要寻找绝对安全的隐僻之处，或许:
… Though the world is vast, there are few places that can hide the edge of the Overlord Sword,
if you want to find a completely safe and secluded spot, perhaps the boundary is the best choice,
if that's the case, that stubborn old guy should be able to help...

…我早已不是你的义父了，多说无益，\n要怪就怪造化弄人吧，或许当初我在无名谷教你:
… I'm no longer your Foster Father, there's no point in saying more,
if you want to blame someone, blame fate. Maybe when I was teaching you swordsmanship in Wuming Valley,
it was already destined that today we would face this life-or-death battle here.

…晚辈与萧茵交手过几次，对她略有所知，\n她的心思神秘难测，似乎有某种…未知的力:
… I have fought Xiao Yin a few times and know a little about her,
Her thoughts are mysterious and unfathomable, as if there is some kind of... Unknown forces guide her,
if she managed to sneak into Kaifeng, General Gao's premonition might come true,

…申大哥，记得孙前辈之前对你说过，\n若要避开那命中注定的灾劫，最好别回来汉阳，:
… Brother Shen, I remember Senior Sun once told you,
if you want to avoid that destined disaster, it's best not to return to Hanyang,
have you forgotten what she said?

…真是遗憾，没想到事情会变成这样，\n如果在下早点去见简大人，或许最后不至于如此:
… It's truly a pity, I never expected things to turn out like this,
if I had gone to see Lord Jian earlier, perhaps things wouldn't have ended like this,
At this point, all I can do is ask the children's parents to accept their condolences and go along with the changes.

…这柄青铜钥匙大得出奇，而且型状十分奇特，\n如果这也是丁大人在兴建宫殿时与那残:
… This bronze key was unusually large and had a very unusual shape,
if this was also discovered together with the fragmentary register when Lord Ding was building the palace,
perhaps it has some connection to the underground ruins in Kaifeng that I had visited before,

…这洞里的水深不见底，大小恰可让一人通过，\n若我没猜错的话，当初那些跳进开封护:
… The water in this cave is bottomless, just big enough for one person to pass through,
if I'm not mistaken, those fugitives who jumped into Kaifeng's moat back then,
you enter Wuyou Cave by swimming here through an underground channel.

…这道石门非常厚实，似乎是用来封闭古墓之用，\n若真是如此，那这道门就绝无可能从:
… This stone gate was extremely thick, seemingly designed to seal the ancient tomb,
if that were really the case, then there was absolutely no way this door could have been opened from the outside,
Looks like I'll have to find another way...

…项王，我尽力了…但你绝不能把魂魄输给了霸剑，\n若你继续任它支配自己的意识，它:
… Xiang Yu, I did my best... But you must never lose your soul to Ba Jian,
if you continue to let it dominate your consciousness, it will completely take over your mind,
you will lose yourself forever, and everything will be beyond saving...

…高奉，你在咒术上确有过人的天赋，\n如果存善心修道，原可成为得天慧之人，可惜你:
… Gao Feng, you truly have extraordinary talent in spell arts,
if one cultivates the Way with a kind heart, one could have become a person of heavenly wisdom. Unfortunately, your heart is full of desires,
Stubbornly refusing to awaken, you will fall deep into the depths of evil paths, and the consequences will surely be close at hand,

…高奉，很遗憾你没那么多时间了，\n若你还记得上次吃的苦头，就快把觉生大师交还给:
… Gao Feng, it's a pity you don't have that much time left,
if you still remember the hardships you endured last time, hurry up and hand Master Juesheng back to us,
if you remain stubborn, we are happy to teach you a lesson once more.

上回你们败在我剑下，差点尽数命丧我手，\n这回汉阳府暗中设下埋伏，你原可在旁坐收:
Last time you were defeated by my sword, nearly losing your lives at my hand,
this time, Hanyang Prefecture has set up an ambush, so you can sit back and reap the benefits,
while we were ambushed, and while we were attacked, we could also take the opportunity to avenge the last arrow,

不知为何，我觉得那位小二哥说的是真话，\n如果这襄阳城里有闹鬼的地方…我倒想去瞧:
For some reason, I felt that waiter was telling the truth,
if there are haunted places in Xiangyang... I actually want to take a look,
By the way, help Manager Wang. What do you all think?

不过…那柄剑有些令人不解的奇妙之处，\n若申少侠不介意的话，那些就留待日后将剑交:
However... That sword had some mysterious and inexplicable qualities,
if Young Hero Shen doesn't mind, then those will be saved for the day when I hand over the sword to you,
let me explain it to you in detail.

不过他说闭门不出，这就全然是假话了，\n若非我曾亲眼目睹数次，大概也不会相信堂堂:
But saying he stayed indoors and didn't go out was completely false,
if I hadn't witnessed it several times myself, I probably wouldn't have believed that the dignified leader of the Tianxuan Sect,
he actually changed into black at night and wore a teal mask,

不过这酒不够劲，无法让我在巨浪中掌稳船舵，\n如果你能帮俺弄坛够劲的好酒…例如「:
But the wine wasn't strong enough to keep me steady in the giant waves,
if you can help me make good wine with enough strength... For example, "the Baxianju",
No matter how rough the waves are, I won't hesitate to take you out to sea.

他们前阵子从外地找来了一名叫公输彻的机关高手，\n若王某猜的没错，沈家似乎想在宅:
Recently, they had brought in a master of mechanisms named Gongshu Che from out of town,
if Wang's guess is correct, the Shen family seems to want to do something under the house,
although the details are unknown, it may be related to Cuixiang's disappearance...

他多半是遇上了什么超出自己能力的麻烦，\n若我以帮他解决这个麻烦来做为交换条件，:
He was probably facing some trouble beyond his ability,
if I offer to help him solve this trouble in exchange,
he would probably be happy to return the greatsword, and I think that's the best way.

他还说这古墓之前从没被人偷盗过，\n如果找到值钱的古物，一定会马上拿来抵债，\n:
He also said that this ancient tomb had never been robbed before,
if he found a valuable antique, he would immediately use it to pay off the debt,
At that time, I was quite looking forward to seeing what he might find.

但原本应该不过寸许的地蠋却长得如此巨大，\n若不是看到牠用来躲藏的这一堆土石，\:
But Earthgrub, which should have been only about an inch long, has grown so huge,
if it weren't for seeing the pile of earth and rocks it used to hide,
I really couldn't recognize her at first.

你说的是…此刻最要紧的就是将霸剑带离此地，\n若有任何汉军士卒在这里看到我，就有:
What you're talking about... The most urgent thing now was to take the Overlord Sword away from here,
if any Han soldier sees me here, it might reach Liu Bang,
if he suspects that the whereabouts of the Overlord Sword are related to me, then things will get complicated.

像前几天那样在外面餐风露宿的总是不好，\n灵瑄妹子不介意的话，我们可以安排妳到熟:
It's never good to be exposed outside like a few days ago,
if Lingxuan doesn't mind, we can arrange for you to stay at someone you know,
Eating and lodging there won't be a problem, so you can wait for Third Senior Brother to return with peace of mind.

公子不妨留心注意这附近的岩壁，\n若有哪里看起来最近被人动过，\n或许就是枢纽的:
Young master, you might as well pay close attention to the nearby rock walls,
if any part of it looks like someone has been touched recently,
perhaps it is the location of the hub.

动手向来只会多伤和气，对我们彼此并无好处，\n若郸厉前辈愿意见告，我们自然想明白:
Physical contact only harms harmony and does neither of us any good,
if Senior Dan Li is willing to tell us, we naturally want to understand the whole story,
could Senior Dan Li first explain the situation with the woman in the sink?

原来如此。那么这件事在下先记住了，\n在下将来若闯进无忧洞，会特别留意像这样的黏:
So that's how it is. So I'll remember this first,
if I venture into Wuyou Cave in the future, I will pay special attention to clay pillars like this,
if anything is found, he will bring it back and return it to the owner.

原来是申少侠。既然是王官人的朋友，简某就有话直说了，\n若说到古怪之事…简某想起:
It turned out to be Young Hero Shen. Since he is a friend of Mr. Wang, I will speak frankly,
if you talk about strange things... Jian recalled something that happened to a regular customer,
if Young Hero Shen is willing to help, perhaps some clues can be found.

可是…可是我已经答应了许二娘子，\n如果我们在此坐视不管，因而错过了救人的机会，:
But... But I have already promised Lady Xu,
if we stand by and do nothing, and thus miss the chance to save others,
she would surely think that as a great martial arts sect, we kept our word...

听来这些失踪案件肯定与无忧洞有关，\n若要查明真相，就非得进去那里，探个究竟不可:
It seemed these disappearance cases were definitely connected to Wuyou Cave,
if you want to uncover the truth, you have to go in and find out the truth,
if that's the case... I'll make another trip to the Imperial City Office later.

吾乃北方黑龙帝君，于此问自称来继人皇者，\n汝欲行封禅之仪，必已齐备朱玺、紫镜、:
I am the Black Dragon Emperor of the North, and here I ask who claims to succeed the Human Emperor,
if you wish to perform the Fengshan ceremony, you must have already prepared the three vessels: the vermilion seal, the purple mirror, and the spiritual sword,
you should present the Purple Yan Divine Mirror before the platform, awaiting my judgment, to prove your true nature.

吾乃南方赤龙帝君，于此问自称来继人皇者，\n汝欲行封禅之仪，必已齐备朱玺、紫镜、:
I am the Crimson Dragon Sovereign of the South, and hereby I ask who claims to succeed the Human Emperor,
if you wish to perform the Fengshan ceremony, you must have already prepared the three vessels: the vermilion seal, the purple mirror, and the spiritual sword,
I shall present the spiritual sword of the mortal world on the Sword Inquiry Platform, awaiting my judgment, so that I may prove your true self.

吾乃西方白龙帝君，于此问自称来继人皇者，\n汝欲行封禅之仪，必已齐备朱玺、紫镜、:
I am the White Dragon Emperor of the West, and here I ask who claims to succeed the Human Emperor,
if you wish to perform the Fengshan ceremony, you must have already prepared the three vessels: the vermilion seal, the purple mirror, and the spiritual sword,
I shall present the Zhu Ming Heavenly Seal before the platform, awaiting my judgment, to testify to your identity.

周兄，你身为名闻天下的紫云派首徒，\n若为了一时冲动，将这批师弟门人尽数送上死路:
Brother Zhou, as the renowned top disciple of the Ziyun Sect,
if you act on impulse and send all these junior disciples to their deaths,
so what your sect might lose isn't just its reputation.

周公子不但个性豪爽，也喜欢结交各方能人异士，\n如果申少侠打算在杭州待上一段时日:
Young Master Zhou was not only bold and generous, but also enjoyed befriending talented people from all walks of life,
if Young Master Shen plans to stay in Hangzhou for a while,
Young Master Zhou will warmly welcome you as his honored guests.

呵呵，申公子你们不需客气，\n若是没有你们帮忙把那些人打发走，\n这件事只怕会弄:
Heh, Young Master Shen, there's no need to be so polite,
if you hadn't helped send those people away,
this matter is likely to spiral out of control.

呵呵，申小子你别紧张…我早就警觉到了，\n要是我拿到镇水珠后就乖乖的交出去，\n:
Hehe, Shen kid, don't be nervous... I had long been alert,
if I obediently hand over the Water Suppression Pearl after getting it,
perhaps the Jiao King will no longer need me as a servant, so...

嗯…不过龙形其实就是龙皇，并非假货赝品，\n此事若葛前辈地下有知，明白龙皇确实曾:
Hmm... However, the dragon shape is actually the Dragon Emperor, not a fake,
if Senior Ge knew about this from the underworld, he would understand that the Dragon Emperor had indeed once obtained it for him,
maybe he can finally pass away with a smile and no more regrets...

嗯…听来这人并非真正的崆峒弟子，\n如果他假冒敝派名义收钱除妖，那就非同小可，\:
Hmm... It seemed this person was not a true Kongtong disciple,
if he impersonates our sect to collect money to exterminate demons, that would be no small matter,
I need to go back and report this to Senior Brother first.

嗯…地蠋特别厌恶一种叫「黔芦草」的药草的气味，\n如果能在附近采到黔芦草，榨出汁:
Hmm... Earthgrub especially dislikes the scent of a herb called 'Qianlu Herb',
if you can pick Qianlu Herb nearby, squeeze out its juice, and spread it on the hay,
The smoke from the burning might be enough to force Earthgrub out.

嗯…由这天圆地方之构、擎岳悬云之势看来，\n若老夫所料不差，在天地之间这样的地方:
Hmm... Judging from this round heaven and square earth structure, and the posture of mountains holding up suspended clouds,
if my guess is correct, there should be only one place like this between heaven and earth,
that is the 'Fengchan Platform' where the True Emperor and Heaven and Earth have fulfilled their covenant...

嗯，我的感觉与瑶妹一样，\n如果那位公输兄真的进了这座古墓，\n只希望他现在人还:
Hmm, I feel the same way as Yao,
if that Gongshu brother really entered this ancient tomb,
I just hope he's still safe and sound now...

嗯，有人在此布下了乱界…看来张良又抢先了我们一步，\n若是光朝一个方向走，就会一:
Hmm, someone has set up a chaotic boundary here... It seems Zhang Liang has beaten us to it again,
if you just walk in one direction, you'll always return to where you started, never able to leave,
it seems he intends to use this method to hold us back, so the pursuers can catch up from behind.

嗯，根据血灵枢使身上「血灵神珠」的感应，\n我想他们应该位于此地东南方不超过五十:
Hmm, based on the sensing of the 'Blood Spirit Divine Pearl' on the Blood Spirit Pivot Envoy,
I think they should be no more than fifty li southeast of here,
if you head in that direction, you should be able to find them,

在下平时四处游历，经常往来于各城镇之间，\n若费老板不介意的话，或许在下可以乘便:
I usually travel around, frequently traveling between various towns and cities,
if Boss Fei doesn't mind, maybe I can take the opportunity to keep an eye on it for you,
may I ask what the name of Master Ge's young master is?

在荒山野道行路时，总有机会遇上一些毒物，\n倘若不慎遇袭中毒，使用化毒散便可化解:
When traveling through wild mountains and paths, there is always a chance to encounter some poisonous creatures,
if you are accidentally attacked or poisoned, using Hua Du San can neutralize the toxins in your body,
you seem to walk around often, so you should have something on hand.

多谢婆婆，我这就去向徐兄询问当夜的详情，\n若能收集到更多线索，或许就能找到这黑:
Thank you, mother-in-law. I'll go ask Brother Xu about the details of that night,
if more clues could be gathered, perhaps they could find this black-clad stranger,
please rest assured, mother-in-law. We will do our best.

多谢穆兄毛遂自荐，不过也请让褚某凑个热闹，\n若能让老夫在场，或许申少侠会愿意卖:
Thank you, Brother Mu, for volunteering yourself, but please let me join in the fun,
if I could be present, perhaps Young Hero Shen would be willing to show me some face,
Privately, maybe he would tell us more.

多谢萧姑娘的好意，不过恕我不能从命，\n若妳的意图危及开封城的无数百姓，甚至掀起:
Thank you for your kindness, Miss Xiao, but forgive me for not being able to comply,
if your intentions endanger the countless people of Kaifeng, or even cause a catastrophic disaster,
so even if I have to be your enemy, I won't just stand by and do nothing.

大师兄，他说得没错，\n如果我们拼掉性命也不是他的对手，\n全都白死在这里对师门:
Senior Brother, he's right,
if we risk our lives, we are no match for him,
if everyone dies here in vain, what benefit does it bring to the sect?

好说，希望这封铸之法能派得上用场，\n将来若有什么我们能效劳之处，\n还请申少侠:
Fine, I hope this sealing and casting method will be useful,
if there is anything in the future where we can help,
please, Young Hero Shen, just say the word—don't be shy."

好说，这几天被招待了不少好酒好菜，\n若不找机会挥挥手上的枪稍微活动一下筋骨，\:
Honestly, we've been treated to plenty of fine wine and food these past few days,
if you don't find a chance to loosen your muscles a bit with your gun,
I felt like I couldn't hold my belt anymore.

如今三垣的偏移已近天极，萧茵在等的应该就是这个，\n若我的推占没错，她很可能会挑:
Now that the three enclosures have shifted near the celestial pole, Xiao Yin must be waiting for this,
if my prediction is correct, she will most likely choose a recent night to take action,
you need to pay close attention to any sudden visions to avoid missing the chance to stop her.

如今项王的名声轰传四方，无人不知，\n若问当今谁有资格取代秦成为天下的霸主，\n:
Now Xiang Yu's reputation spreads far and wide, everyone knows about it,
if you ask who today is qualified to replace Qin as the hegemon of the world,
Anyone would say that besides Xiang Yu, there was no one else.

如你所知，领头的萧茵不但身手了得而且精通咒术，\n虽然尚不清楚他们潜入开封城的目:
As you know, the leader, Xiao Yin, is not only highly skilled but also skilled in spells,
although it was still unclear why they infiltrated Kaifeng, it was certain their intentions were not good,
if they intend to strike against the court or the emperor, it is far beyond what ordinary soldiers can handle,

如果你坚持要玩命，或许简二可以陪你走这一趟，\n如果这里找不到他，多半就是在敬宾:
If you insist on risking your life, maybe Jian Er can accompany you on this trip,
if you can't find him here, it's most likely you're drinking in the Jingbin Building,
you might want to go there and look for it.

如果我去邹县拜访他，求他收我为学徒，\n一边在医铺里帮忙一边请教医经上的疑难，\:
If I go to Zou County to visit him and ask him to take me as an apprentice,
while helping out in the clinic, he also sought advice on medical classics,
I think Uncle Li probably wouldn't refuse.

孙某见几位走向程家大院，似要入内拜访，\n若几位认识这些崆峒派人众，\n可能帮孙:
Sun saw several people approaching the Cheng family courtyard, seemingly intending to enter and pay a visit,
if any of you know these Kongtong Sect members,
maybe you can introduce me to Sun?

封界一消散，便再也无法阻止即将完成的「血神绝煞阵」，\n凶神血涡中的血魂凶魄已在:
Once the Sealed Realm dissipated, it could no longer stop the soon-to-be-completed 'Blood God Absolute Fiend Formation',
The blood soul and fierce spirit within the Fierce God's Blood Whirlpool have accumulated countless spiritual powers over a thousand years,
if the evil formation were to be activated now, its momentum would far surpass that of Lü Can's tactics,

小伙子，你对此事如此热心，那就再好不过啦，\n若你想帮忙的话，可以去官府找一位叫:
Young man, if you're so enthusiastic about this, that's all the better,
if you want to help, you can go to the authorities and ask a judge named Jian Zhong,
I remember he looked troubled and told us there was no evidence.

小伙子，看来你和在下一样钟情于使剑之道，\n若你想寻求更多历练的机会，我可以教你:
Young man, it seems you are as passionate about the art of swordsmanship as I am,
if you want more opportunities to gain experience, I can teach you a little trick,
are you interested in hearing it?

小女子不敢多求什么，只想请托少侠您在外游历之时，\n帮忙留意是否有里面放着三清令:
I dare not ask for much, I only wish to ask for help while you are away traveling, young hero,
Help keep an eye out for any luggage containing the Three Pure Ones token,
if you have similar items, please be sure to bring them to me for a look,

少帮主，您不能这么没志气！小的十分肯定，\n那把「玄真剑」并非寻常之物，据说能应:
Young Master, you can't be so lacking in ambition! I am very certain,
that 'Xuanzhen Sword' is no ordinary item; it is said to enhance its power by responding to internal energy,
if the Young Leader could obtain this divine weapon, his swordsmanship would surely advance by leaps and bounds,

就是挑选一只特别强壮生猛的公鸡，\n每天喂牠壮元大补的药材，养足十个月后与七种药:
It was about choosing a particularly strong and lively rooster,
Every day, feed it strong and nourishing medicinal herbs, and after ten months of care, stew them together with seven kinds of herbs,
let Xiaozhuzi drink this chicken soup to unblock the blocked meridians he had injured in the wound,

庞伥，你别以自己的小人之心度人家君子之腹，\n若汉阳军已在外面设下埋伏，你一出去:
Pang Chang, don't judge others with your petty heart,
if the Hanyang army has already set an ambush outside, as soon as you go out, you'll be covered in arrows,
Why would Young Hero Shen risk coming here to negotiate with us?

当然了，我等不会拿这理由就白占你的便宜，\n若你手中有足够的「离魂散魄」，我等愿:
Of course, we won't use that as an excuse to take advantage of you,
if you have enough 'Soul-Scattering Powder' in hand, we are willing to exchange Yuan Dan for it,
if you see someone of our generation in the city, feel free to greet us.

徐州古来是兵家必争之地，附近曾发生过多次大战，\n若在阴天或刮风起雾时到城外，总:
Xuzhou has always been a strategic military stronghold, with many major battles taking place nearby,
if I go outside the city on cloudy days or when it's windy or foggy, I always feel something is off,
Still, this bright, sunny day like this is the most comfortable.

我们正好与开封府有些交情，可以设法说动他们重审此案，\n若能洗清黄兄的冤情，黄兄:
We happen to have some connections with the Kaifeng Prefecture, so we can try to persuade them to reopen the case,
if Brother Huang's wrongful conviction can be cleared, and he deeply regrets his past actions,
By offsetting the wrongful charges suffered by Brother Huang, perhaps we can request the Kaifeng Prefecture to grant mercy and pardon,

我名叫袁裕，在襄阳军都监担任军器使之职，\n负责军营里的各式兵器整补，由于襄阳乃:
My name is Yuan Yu, and I serve as the Military Equipment Commissioner in Xiangyang,
he was responsible for refurbishing various weapons within the camp. Since Xiangyang was a strategic location among the armies,
if the Kaifeng Armory had any new weapons, they would first send them here for trial,

我引这封界之力，在周围下了搜灵引脉的咒术，\n若地下埋藏有与封界相关的不寻常之物:
I channeled the power of the Sealed Realm and cast a spell to search the Spirit Meridians around me,
if there are unusual objects buried underground related to The Sealed Realm,
it would flicker with a barely noticeable blue glow.

我明白萧姑娘的想法…这样也好，\n若真有这么一柄神异之剑，我倒也很想亲眼看看，\:
I understand what Miss Xiao is thinking... That's fine too,
if such a miraculous sword really existed, I would love to see it with my own eyes,
I look forward to you finding Bajian and fulfilling the mission you believe in.

或许老天垂怜，会有那个好心的湖盗将它留下，\n若您在他们手中发现类似的本册，请务:
Perhaps heaven will have mercy, and that kind-hearted lake bandit will keep it here,
if you find a similar book in their hands, please be sure to show it to me,
if you can help me recover that account book, I will surely reward you handsomely.

所以…我相信那个遥远而熟悉的梦是真的，\n若现在的一切注定无法改变，那么不论将来:
So... I believe that distant yet familiar dream is real,
if everything now is destined to be unchangeable, then no matter what happens in the future,
I hope at least I can make you understand how I feel right now...

所以此事必定不假…而不论申无名取得了什么兵刃，\n倘若他的剑法能胜过左真人，他就:
So this matter must be true... And no matter what weapons Shen Wuming obtained,
if his swordsmanship could surpass Master Zuo's, he would become the greatest threat in the martial world,
as the leading orthodox sects, our five major sects must take action in this regard.

据我所知，此地应该就是这古墓的最深处，\n如果有什么机关枢纽，多半就在这房间里面:
As far as I know, this place should be the deepest part of this ancient tomb,
if there were any mechanism or hub, it was probably inside this room,
now that the ferocious beasts have been eliminated, we can search here slowly.

既然于娬与庞伥这两人是一伙的，\n若他们连手来攻，肯定是非常难对付的强敌，\n杨:
Since Yu Wu and Pang Chang are in cahoots,
if they join forces to attack, they will definitely be a very formidable opponent,
Senior Brother Yang, we need to be well prepared for this.

既然如此，穆某自愿负起向申少侠询问详情之责，\n若申少侠信得过穆某，就由穆某另择:
Since that is the case, Mu volunteers to take on the responsibility of asking Young Hero Shen for details,
if Young Hero Shen trusts me, then I can choose another time and place,
I invite Young Hero Shen over for a talk. What do you think?

既然这回又碰上了她，或许能趁机多了解她一些，\n若她愿意听我说话，我也会设法劝她:
Since he had run into her again this time, perhaps he could take the opportunity to get to know her better,
if she is willing to listen to me, I will find a way to persuade her to give up and leave,
it would be best if both sides could resolve the issue without conflict.

有他老人家坐镇指挥，对方肯定讨不到好去，\n若能得申少侠之助，或许还能擒下庞伥此:
With him commanding the situation, the other side definitely won't get away with it,
if we can get the help of Young Hero Shen, perhaps we can still capture that scoundrel Pang Chang,
he might even be forced to hand over the unique antidote for the cold poison.

杭州毕竟位于南方，暑热瘴疠在所难免，\n倘若水土不服或是上吐下泻，及早服药调解便:
After all, Hangzhou is located in the south, so summer heat and miasma are inevitable,
if there is a lack of adaptation to the climate or vomiting and diarrhea, taking medicine early to regulate it is not a big problem,
don't neglect or delay to worsen the condition, or it will be difficult to treat.

正是。三千六百年之限已近…天地之契的力量所剩无几，\n若不行封禅复位天地之契，这:
Exactly. The 3,600-year limit is approaching... The power of the Heaven and Earth contract is nearly gone,
if the Fengshan sacrifices are not carried out to restore the mandate of Heaven and Earth, these disasters and anomalies will only intensify,
All hope depended on whether the destined Emperor could once again complete the Fengshan ceremony.

此刻最重要的还是设法带着许兄平安离开这里，\n若朱兄精通崆峒派的不传之密，那便再:
At this moment, the most important thing was to find a way to get Brother Xu out of here safely,
if Brother Zhu were well-versed in the secrets of the Kongtong Sect, that would be even better,
we can join forces to take on the Black Fell Ghost blocking our way.

此剑虽与公子有所关连，但尚未完全修复，\n铭契不全，或许会有煞戾之性显露于外，\:
Although this sword is somewhat connected to the young master, it has not yet been fully restored,
if the inscription is incomplete, perhaps a malevolent and violent nature will be revealed,
I believe that before their nature is fully understood, it is best to keep them hidden and not used, in order to avoid their evil.

此地气息沉闷污浊，应该是封闭已久的处所，\n如果这里真是战国时代楚都彭城的地下密:
The atmosphere here is heavy and foul, likely a place long sealed off,
if this really is the underground chamber of Pengcheng, the Chu capital during the Warring States period,
Right now, we're breathing the air from a thousand years ago.

此时只可往正北、正东、正西、正南而行，\n若途中偏离了方向，就得设法走回到枯树那:
At this time, one can only go due north, due east, due west, or due south,
if you stray from the path along the way, you have to find a way to return to the dead tree and start over,
Once again, please kindly guide us in the right direction.

此时胜负已分，但与役群豪与各派弟子也死伤惨重，\n当在场众人正忙于救治伤者、清理:
At this point, the outcome was decided, but the local heroes and disciples from various sects also suffered heavy casualties,
while everyone present was busy treating the wounded and cleaning up the scattered corpses,
suddenly, an uninvited guest dressed in black arrived—Shen Wuming...

此等滥权徇私的恶劣行径，\n若是被我们以无故扰民为由上告到知军大人那里，\n你们:
Such heinous acts of abuse of power and favoritism,
if we report this to the Commander on the grounds of disturbing the people without cause,
although your Lord Shi Quan is a prefectural inspector, it might not be safe for him...

灵瑄妹子，事情未必如妳想的那么糟，\n若妳信得过我们，让我们知道妳的师承与三师兄:
Lingxuan, things may not be as bad as you think,
if you trust us, let us know your master's lineage and the name of Third Senior Brother,
Out of the camaraderie among martial arts practitioners, we will do our best to help you find a solution.

然而前些日子的地震憾断了地脉与山壁中的水路，\n若泉水淹没了这墓室，「勘明医经」:
However, a recent earthquake severed the water routes between the earth veins and the mountain walls,
if the spring water floods this burial chamber, the 'Kanming Medical Canon' will be destroyed in an instant,
and once the earth veins are severed, the spiritual energy gradually dissipates, and my soul can no longer sustain itself.

然而真魄一旦解放，便从此失去永生不灭的天人之身，\n若之后再受到致死的重伤，便会:
However, once the true soul is released, it loses its immortal celestial body,
if they suffer fatal injuries afterward, their bodies and souls will be destroyed on the spot,
Shattered into scattered souls dancing in the void, no divine artifact or method could save it,

瑶妹不用在意，姑娘大都喜欢漂亮的簪花项链，\n如果妳真的想要那个紫晶首饰，那么不:
Yao Mei, don't worry about it; most girls like beautiful floral necklaces,
if you really want that amethyst jewelry, no matter how much effort it takes,
I insisted on getting it and giving it to you—this is my token of appreciation,

申公子，吴某看得出你们并非寻常人物，\n若你们在这里找到任何古物，请务必拿来给我:
Young Master Shen, I can tell that you are no ordinary people,
if you find any antiques here, please be sure to show them to me,
as long as it was a relic of Chu, the Gongshu family's debts would be written off completely.

申大哥，我真的很后悔…当日好心要他去找大师兄，\n若是让人品如此低劣之人继续高居:
Brother Shin, I really regret it... That day, he kindly asked him to go find the eldest senior brother,
if someone with such poor character continues to hold the position of senior uncle below the sect leader,
The Kongtong Sect would inevitably be destroyed by his hands one day.

白家的财产早已捉襟见肘，大公子却不承认是自己的错，\n他坚决不肯让别人代替他经营:
The Bai family's assets were already stretched thin, yet the eldest son refused to admit it was his fault,
he firmly refused to let anyone else manage the business on his behalf, maintaining his original style,
if he kept going like this, Jinhua Pavilion would eventually close down,

看来我反倒要感谢那神武观主设下这陷阱，\n若非如此，我就不会有机会得窥这前所未见:
It seems I should actually thank the Master of Shenwu Temple for setting this trap,
if not for this, I wouldn't have had the chance to glimpse this unprecedentedly deep underground palace,
now I'm getting more and more curious about what is hidden deep within this place...

竹林里有个用来防范不轨之徒的小迷阵，\n如果解不开那迷阵，竹林就是普通的竹林，\:
In the bamboo forest, there is a small maze set used to guard against wrongdoers,
if you can't solve that maze, the bamboo forest is just an ordinary bamboo forest,
and could never get into the bamboo hut where Sister Yan lived,

算你说得有理…既然如此，咱们谁也不欠谁了，\n于娬能捡回这条命，日后自当闭门苦练:
You make a good point... Since that's the case, neither of us owes anyone anymore,
if Yu Wu can save his life, he will surely train hard behind closed doors in the future to avenge today's humiliation,
Shen Zijun, I will definitely come back to learn from you again in the future.

老夫有个预感，隐界与你的宿命有着重大关连，\n如果这一切都是宿命的安排…那么隐界:
I have a premonition that The Hidden Realm is deeply connected to your destiny,
if all of this is fate... So the secret of The Hidden Realm,
perhaps it will gradually be revealed to us through this jade slip,

而你手上这柄剑虽非凡品，却也已经受了相当损伤，\n从刚才的金铁相击之声听来，剑身:
And although the sword in your hand is no ordinary item, it has already suffered considerable damage,
Judging from the clashing of metal just now, the blade was already covered in cracks,
if this sword breaks during a full-force clash, you will surely die,

而光凭人皇霸剑之威，未必能让赵宋与大辽拱手称臣，\n要强行从他们手中取得天下，势:
Yet relying solely on the might of the Human Emperor's Overlord Sword, it may not be enough to make Zhao Song and Great Liao submit without resistance,
if we try to forcibly seize the realm from them, it will inevitably stir up turmoil again,
if this causes a major conflict, the friends I know will not escape the ravages of war and war,

而在太祖皇帝神秘驾崩后，这秘密似乎再也无人知晓，\n若非宫中遭遇祝融之灾，以致那:
After the mysterious death of the Taizu Emperor, this secret seemed to be unknown to anyone,
if it had not been for the disaster of Zhu Rong in the palace, which unexpectedly ended up with me as a broken copy,
this secret buried deep beneath Kaifeng may never be known to anyone,

而妳虽然已经不是崆峒弟子，却仍是他亲手养大的义女，\n如果妳不忘这段缘分，他希望:
And although you are no longer a disciple of Kongtong, you are still his adopted daughter raised by his own hands,
if you don't forget this bond, he hopes you can one day return to Tianling Peak,
Together with him... One stick of incense burned before the eldest senior brother's spirit.

而皇甫师弟与灵瑄妹子又是偷偷逃离本门，\n倘若给左真人发现他们两人躲在这里，以他:
Meanwhile, Junior Brother Huangfu and Lingxuan's younger sister secretly escaped from their main sect,
if Master Zuo found the two of them hiding here, given his violent personality,
In a fit of rage, he might take it out on the Bai family, and the consequences would be unimaginable.

若我没猜错的话，我主人的仙术正是那个坏老头妖法的克星，\n如果你们被他的邪法挡住:
If I'm not mistaken, my master's sage technique is the nemesis of that bad old man's demon magic,
if your path is blocked by his evil laws,
I guess the power of this immortal seal might come in handy.

范知府平时交游广阔，似乎也与一些名门大派有交情，\n若遇上官府不擅处理的事，他也:
Prefect Fan usually had a wide circle of friends and seemed to have ties with some prestigious sects,
if he encountered matters the authorities were not good at handling, he would invite these sects to assist,
so there's no need to be surprised to see martial artists in Xuzhou.

莹妹，这地宫的庞大幽深远在我的想象之上，\n若非妳找到了当年的记载，真难相信这是:
Yingmei, the vastness and depth of this underground palace far surpass my imagination,
if you hadn't found the records from back then, it's hard to believe these were built during the Shang dynasty,
Plus, strange formations set up everywhere... It seems the merchant is no ordinary person.

记得薛夫人之前说过薛老爷长年卧病在床，\n如果一直没有起色，或许应该让薛夫人另觅:
I remember Lady Xue once said that Master Xue had been bedridden for years,
if there was no improvement, perhaps Lady Xue should find another good doctor,
this is to avoid missing the opportunity for treatment.

话说回来，在下在此事中不过是略尽跑腿之劳而已，\n若非之前余姥姥指点在下去搜查城:
That said, I have only done a bit of errands in this matter,
if Granny Yu hadn't previously advised her to search the ferries in the city,
even if you search for ten days or half a month, you never expect the clues to solve the case to be on the ship's deck,

还有…在过去究竟曾经发生过些什么，\n让这个原本应该是用来联系天地两端的天外要所:
And... What exactly happened in the past,
let this vital place originally meant to connect the two ends of heaven and earth,
have you become so hollow, lifeless, and pale?

这个么…大师认为我与佛法有缘，向我说法开示，\n若我将来能参悟其中奥妙，说不定也:
Well... The master believed I had a connection with the Dharma and taught me the Dharma,
if I can one day comprehend its mysteries, perhaps I too will consider shaving my head and becoming a monk,
I was just thinking about what Dharma name to take after ordination...

这些「辟瘴仙符」你带在身上，在进入洞内之后，\n若发现「瘴气之源」就将这贴上，尽:
You carry these 'Miasma-Repelling Immortal Talismans' with you, and after entering the cave,
if you find the 'source of miasma,' stick it on to try to disperse the miasma inside the cave,
so when you encounter the Nine-Miasma Bonefiend, it might benefit from less geographical advantages,

这些信息应该是写在纸上传递，有可能留存下来，\n若申少侠在湖盗身上找到书信之类，:
This information should be written down and passed down on paper, possibly preserved,
if Young Hero Shen finds any letters or similar items on the lake bandits, please be sure to hand them over to me,
From the handwriting on it, perhaps one can identify who the traitor is.

这会是我们最后一次见面，诅咒的力量正在做困兽之斗，\n若你成功的再次打倒我，就能:
This will be our last meeting; the power of the curse is fighting like a cornered beast,
if you succeed in defeating me again, you can completely lift the curse of the demonic eye,
and if you fail, all your previous efforts will be wasted...

这倒不劳你多虑…别忘了我是你们的敌人，\n要是真的让我找到什么神物，于你们反倒是:
That's not something you need to worry about... Don't forget, I am your enemy,
if I really find some divine artifact, it would be a huge disadvantage for you,
you still hope we can leave here empty-handed and safe.

这封信在这个时候送来，时机也未免太过凑巧，\n要不是你们身上带着判官铁令，不至于:
The timing of this letter being delivered at this moment was far too coincidental,
if you weren't carrying the Judge's Iron Order, you wouldn't resort to such tactics,
I really would believe this letter was a trick you set up...

这批妖人横行无阻、肆无忌惮，视我等于无物，\n倘若置之不理，危害必大，咱们五大派:
These demons run rampant and recklessly, treating us as nothing,
if we ignore them, the harm will be great. Our five major sects should join forces to eliminate them,
Master Murong has always been resourceful; surely he already has a brilliant plan in mind?

这类凶兽本就狞猛，又被咒术所缚而格外凶暴，\n如果在大意闯入石室时遇上守卫的凶兽:
These ferocious beasts are already ferocious, and bound by spells, they are especially ferocious,
if you accidentally break into the stone chamber and encounter the guarding beasts, and you can't retreat in time,
Most likely, they would die under their claws just like this man.

道家最精深的移天法门，能以自身灵界来牵引浊气，\n将血涡的戾气凶焰导进地脉，转移:
The most profound Daoist method of Moving Heaven can draw in turbid energy through one's own spiritual realm,
channeling the bloody vortex's fierce energy into the earth's veins, transferring it to the wasteland far away from Feng,
let the earth-shattering shock dissipate in the air, perhaps turning this great difficulty into nothingness,

那就太好了。无忧洞长久以来也是皇城司的头痛问题，\n若能找到方法进入地下沟渠，就:
That would be wonderful. Wuyou Cave has long been a headache for the Imperial City Department,
if you can find a way to enter the underground ditches, you can strike directly at these bandit lairs,
if you can wipe them out in one go, the Imperial City Division will surely reward you handsomely.

那就太好啦。阁下对枪法的领悟远胜韦某，\n若你真能由此创出一招枪法，韦某也能厚着:
That would be wonderful. Your understanding of marksmanship far surpasses that of Wei,
if you can really create a spear technique from this, I can shamelessly bask in some glory,
Your previous description is quite fitting, so how about calling it 'Heaven Rushes Fiercely'?

阁下的刀法大开大阖、雄豪逸气，颇有名家风范，\n在下若没猜错，阁下原非出自盗匪一:
Your swordplay is bold and powerful, with a heroic and unrestrained spirit, reminiscent of a master's style,
if I'm not mistaken, you are not originally a top-tier bandit, but a local martial artist,
Why have you fallen into Wuyou Cave today, willingly claiming to be the leader of thieves?

除此之外，此刻只剩我们有机会阻止这场大难发生，\n若我们只顾着自己逃命，任凭绝煞:
Besides that, at this moment, only we have the chance to prevent this catastrophe from happening,
if we only focus on escaping ourselves, letting the Absolute Fiend Formation unleash the Fierce God Blood Vortex,
Countless commoners inside and outside Kaifeng, as well as the royal family and officials in the palace, were all doomed to face disaster,

项王与虞姬两人皆死于霸剑，与它的因缘还不会就此结束，\n如果渡过幽邃黄泉的漫长时:
Both Xiang Yu and Yu Ji died by the Overlord Sword, and their connection to it will not end there,
if the long time spent in the depths of the underworld does not make them forget everything,
I believe... Fate will surely bring them back to this world once again,
